            "review_title": "Review at Hibiki BBQ Thit Wagyu Nuong Hibiki",
            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n2\nOrder the beef tongue and wagyu Omakase at ~1.5million VND. WORTH IT.\nMar 2025 • Family\nCame here some years back, and remembered this was our favourite among other Jap wagyu BBQ restaurants. Returned and found it was still good. Prices and menu seem to be the same, too.\n\nOrder the wagyu Omakase at ~1.5million VND. WORTH IT. Omakase of six specially selected and unique cuts of wagyu - it was fun making out the differences of each. Supposedly for 2 persons, but it was sufficient for us even when sharing with two kids.\n\nTheir authentic Japanese menu also offers seldom available beef tongue BBQ - so do try it if you'd never before/miss it.\n\nWe did not know this earlier, even their normal servings of rice was gigantic!!! \nReminder - to let them know in advance if you don't want such big portions.\n\nThis restaurant is more crowded on weekdays (Jap expats after work) than weekends.\nRead more\nWritten June 4, 2025",
