            "review_text": "YSKing\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam269 contributions\n0\n使い勝手の良い和牛焼肉\nApr 2019 • Friends\n美味しい和牛をリーズナブルな価格でいただけるお店。\nファンビッチャン側からもグエンフーカン通り側からも入店できます。\n炭火の七輪で焼くスタイルです。\n肉はどれも美味しいです！！特にカルビとマルチョウ。\n初めての時は盛り合わせ「響」を注文すれば間違いないと思います。\nまだ開店して間もないですが、スタッフからは丁寧にサービスしようという気持ちが伝わってきます。\nカウンターでお一人様焼肉をできるのもいいですね！\n\nA restaurant where you can get delicious Japanese beef at a reasonable price.\nYou can get in from either Phạm Viết Chánh side or Nguyen Huu Canh Street side.\nIt is style to grill with charcoal fire.\nAll the meat is delicious! ! Especially Karubi and Maruchou.\nI think that if you order \"Hibiki\" assorted for the first time, there is no doubt.\nIt has not been opened yet, but the staff try serve us carefully.\nIt is also good to be able to cook a single person at the counter!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 3, 2019",
